WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.918
Kip was asleep in his hole one night. Crack!

2
00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:19.097
Thunder boomed and rain fell.

3
00:00:19.098 --> 00:00:22.553
Branches snapped.

4
00:00:22.554 --> 00:00:26.136
The whole tree shook.

5
00:00:26.137 --> 00:00:36.497
"Ahh!" Kip cried.

6
00:00:36.498 --> 00:00:43.732
The next morning the storm was over.

7
00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:48.814
Kip woke up in his kitchen.

8
00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:51.961
His bed was floating in water.

9
00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:55.219
Acorns bobbed nearby.

10
00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:58.291
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

11
00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:02.815
"My hole is flooded!"

12
00:01:02.816 --> 00:01:05.217
Just then Kip heard Bird.

13
00:01:05.218 --> 00:01:08.794
"My nest is ruined!" she cried.

14
00:01:08.795 --> 00:01:13.649
Kip went outside and looked down.

15
00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:17.664
Leaves and sticks were everywhere.

16
00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:20.126
Bird was on her branch.

17
00:01:20.127 --> 00:01:25.487
Her nest was a mess.

18
00:01:25.488 --> 00:01:29.153
"This is terrible, Bird," said Kip.

19
00:01:29.154 --> 00:01:32.539
"Our homes are ruined."

20
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.742
"We can fix them," said Bird.

21
00:01:37.743 --> 00:01:40.903
"That's too much work," said Kip.

22
00:01:40.904 --> 00:01:43.151
"I have a better idea."

23
00:01:43.152 --> 00:01:46.229
"What's your idea?" asked Bird.

24
00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.742
"Let's move," said Kip.

25
00:01:48.743 --> 00:01:52.764
"Let's find a new tree!"

